      "writtenOn": "2020-01-09T18:24:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The TBT3 discovery flow explicitly indicates that superspeed support is only checked for passive cables. Further, chapter 6 in the Type-C speci indicates \n\"Active cables shall minimally support USB 3.2 Gen 2x1 and may support USB 3.2 Gen 1x2 or Gen 2x2.\"",
